  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "At Green Ant Ascetic’s disciple recruitment she fights Zhang Shuang as a girl with yellow eyebrows, beautiful features, and shining eyes with double pupils. Qing Suan says she defeated him easily after three humans wore him down. Huang Wei warns Wu Shuai that she has extraordinary strength and was given free passes until Zhang Shuang. Fang Yuan judges her an enslavement path master who often mobilizes troops by instinct with outstanding effect.",
      "chapters": [
        1829
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_green_ant_ascetic",
        "char_huang_wei",
        "char_wu_shuai",
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "She has yellow eyebrows, beautiful features, and double pupils.",
      "chapters": [
        1829
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "In the finals against Wu Shuai she fields more than thirty worker ants and five soldier ants, builds an ant nest while soldier ants protect the workers, and later stations troops at crucial nest routes while enslaving more ants outside. Wu Shuai still beats her, and onlookers say she performed normally while he exceeded his usual standards.",
      "chapters": [
        1830
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "ant-contest",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "In the Dragon Palace dream she gives birth. Wu Shuai names their son Long Ling, and she nods that the name is good. He wants to give her proper status and give the child a bright future as a dragonman.",
      "chapters": [
        1845
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "wife-and-son",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "house_dragon_palace",
        "char_long_ling"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The final step of refining Dream Token is for Tai Qin to make a self sacrifice. She accepts quickly, says she is willing to sacrifice everything including her life, and asks Wu Shuai to nurture their child after she dies. Dream Token is refined, and later their child asks where mother is while Wu Shuai can only lie.",
      "chapters": [
        1845
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "dream-token-sacrifice",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_dream_token"
      ]
    }
  ],
